[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0000","text":"穿运动服的女性１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0010","text":"一、二、三、四────\n一、二、三、四"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0011","text":"穿运动服的女性２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0020","text":"滑步，然后，收……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0021","text":"穿运动服的女性１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0030","text":"好，到这里────\n还有几个地方跟不上呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0040","text":"从那之后练了不少了，怎么办？\n还能继续吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0041","text":"穿运动服的女性２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0050","text":"好，我还想再练一会儿────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0051","text":"穿运动服的女性１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0060","text":"呵呵，是吗\n没有厌烦吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0061","text":"穿运动服的女性２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0070","text":"没有，我很开心\n能和前辈一起，我很高兴……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0080","text":"能一起站上舞台────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0093","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0100","text":"……啊啊……──────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0110","text":"────原来你在这里\n找你了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0120","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0130","text":"……\n刚才，跟工作人员聊到了路加的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0140","text":"是以前就认识路加的人\n还聊到了当时的事────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0150","text":"不想听"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0160","text":"…………\n路加……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0170","text":"不想说……什么都不想说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_03_0180","text":"…………别管我"}]
